PianoVideo/vt carries the VideoToolbox paravirtual frontend from the third-party
repository UniXNU-droidvm-piano, commit 706338e309b410a1f04d87eb3ae009612577aedf.

Source files brought in:
  package/DroidVMVTParavirt.cpp -> PianoVideoVTParavirt.cpp
  package/DroidVMVTHost.cpp     -> PianoVideoVTHost.cpp
  package/DroidVMVTWire.h       -> PianoVideoVTWire.h

The source history needed for this frontend is the channel and decoder series
3df7c94, 1479852, 9d5a0ce, fab4fb1, and 706338e.  The virtio-media transport
and all VM device code are intentionally excluded.  PianoVideoVTStubMedia.cpp
supplies only the 14 transport entry points: it advertises H.264/HEVC decoder
capability through the frontend and returns ENOTSUP for stream operations.

Changes for native PianoVideo V0b:
  * renamed files and include paths; retained upstream droidvm_* symbols as
    internal ABI names only;
  * changed boot control to piano-video-vt=1 and console prefixes to PianoVideo;
  * changed advertised implementation identifiers/descriptions to PianoVideo;
  * added the service properties used by the VideoToolbox support probe;
  * added the capability-only stub backend and no encode device.

